{
  "manufacturer": "Trane",
  "manufacturer_slug": "trane",
  "model": "RTAC air-cooled helical-rotary chiller (UC800 native Modbus profile)",
  "model_slug": "rtac-uc800-native-modbus",
  "short_model": "RTAC UC800 native profile",
  "aliases": [
    "RTAC UC800 native Modbus profile",
    "Series R RTAC UC800 native Modbus",
    "BAS-PTS032A-EN"
  ],
  "equipment_type": "Chiller",
  "applies_to": "Trane RTAC air-cooled chillers on the Tracer UC800 controller using the UC800 native Modbus map in the Modbus section of BAS-PTS032A-EN (12/6/2024). Not the same register set as the Symbio 800 RTAC list (BAS-PTS023A-EN).",
  "summary": "Trane's RTAC is an air-cooled helical-rotary (screw) chiller. On the Tracer UC800 controller it offers a compact native Modbus map in which every point is one 16-bit register with a fixed SI scaling per register type (temperatures in 0.01 °C, pressures in 0.1 kPa absolute, percent in 0.005 % steps). The map covers BAS commands, water and refrigerant temperatures and pressures, oil values, starter currents and voltages, AFD values and status flags.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU",
    "TCP"
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "unit_id": null,
    "baud": null,
    "parity": null,
    "data_bits": null,
    "stop_bits": null,
    "tcp_port": null
  },
  "addressing": {
    "convention": "Modicon",
    "note": "The list prints Modicon register numbers: 4xxxx are holding registers and 3xxxx input registers, so 40001 is holding register address 0 and 30034 is input register address 33."
  },
  "default_word_order": null,
  "firmware": null,
  "source": {
    "title": "Symbio 800 Integration Points List, BACnet/Modbus, RTAC (UC800)",
    "doc_number": "BAS-PTS032A-EN",
    "revision_date": "2024-12-06",
    "url": "https://elibrary.tranetechnologies.com/public/commercial-hvac/Literature/Points%20List/BAS-PTS032A-EN_12062024.pdf",
    "pages": "p. 20 (Modbus object format), pp. 21-25 (holding and input register tables)"
  },
  "notes": [
    "The object-format table gives one encoding per register type: Binary/Enumeration/Current/Voltage/Power/Frequency/Pressure are unsigned 16-bit; Percent, Percent_1, Power Factor, Differential Pressure and Temperature are signed 16-bit. Scales: Temperature 0.01 °C, Pressure 0.1 kPa absolute, Percent 0.005 % (20,000 = 100 %), Percent_1 1 %, Frequency 0.1 Hz, Power kW, Current A, Voltage V. Rows typed 'Temp' are read as Temperature.",
    "Values are always SI in this native map; there is no I-P switch in the list.",
    "Left out: compressor starts and run time (30015-30030), typed Count (u32) and Time (u32) over two registers; the list does not state the word order.",
    "Left out: Number of Circuits / Compressors (30071-30073), typed Count (u32) but printed as single registers, and Chiller Design Capacity (30074), typed 'Number', which the format table does not define.",
    "This RTAC also appears in the library under its Symbio 800 points list (rtac-symbio-800, BAS-PTS023A-EN); that list uses 32-bit float registers and different numbers. Use this map only for the UC800 native Modbus profile.",
    "The points list does not name the Modbus transport (RTU or TCP); it refers to BAS-SVP083*-EN for protocol setup, so confirm the transport in the controller configuration.",
    "Software Type and Software Revision (30001, 30002) are typed 'NA', which the format table does not list; they are shown as plain unsigned 16-bit values (the table's 'None' type)."
  ],
